# --- Machine-specific, never committed -------------------------------------
# This repo is public. Anything that describes one particular host -- LAN IPs,
# drive letters, hardware, library contents, provider accounts -- belongs in
# here rather than in a tracked file.
#
#   local/            scratch space: audits, API dumps, one-off notes
#   CLAUDE.local.md   personal agent instructions, auto-loaded alongside CLAUDE.md
#   docker-compose.override.yml
#                     your own Compose tweaks; start from the .example
local/
CLAUDE.local.md
docker-compose.override.yml
